---
servings: 4
---

Fry chopped @onion{1} in @olive oil{} in a pot until translucent.

Add minced @garlic{4%cloves} in pot and cook until fragrant.

Make the soffrito. Add finely chopped @carrot{4} and @celery{4%sticks}. Cook until softened.

Add @beef mince{500%g} and break up with spoon. Cook until browned.

Add @tomato paste{70%g} and stir.

Add @canned tomatoes{2} and stir.

Add @red wine{1%cup} and @beef stock{2%cup}.

Add @salt{} and @pepper{} to taste.

Cook until liquid has reduced. The longer the better.

Cook @fusilini pasta{500%g} according to packet instructions.
